, then cells will only be generated for properties of type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"NSString and NSNumber, and will be either of type SCTextFieldCell or SCNumericTextFieldCell,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"respectively. If an SCClassDefinition is provided for the bound object, a full fledged"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"section of cells will be generated."}],"title":"SCObjectSection","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scobjectsection","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SCObjectSection"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCObjectSection","type":"topic"}}}